{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SELECT 是一款極簡啟動器，把主畫面從數十個圖示帶來的資訊過載中解放出來，特別適合容易分心、經常為尋找應用程式而浪費時間的使用者，以及希望在專注時徹底隱藏社交媒體的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-29.webp\">\n<h2>五大分頁收納日常場景</h2>\n<p>SELECT 以主畫面小工具只顯示當下真正需要的應用程式，並用接收、記錄、溝通、設定與娛樂五個分頁收納日常場景。使用者可為不同情境建立模式，隱藏娛樂分頁或改用純文字清單，減少視覺干擾；亦支援批量刪除、移動、複製與 iCloud 同步。資料只留在裝置，不收集個人資訊。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-417-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-418-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-419-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-420-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-421-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-422-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SELECT – Minimal pick launcher</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:41:41.917047+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:20:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:56:06.299103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:37:44.316658+00:00","content_hash":"9e277989881e902ed2a143d7d72218a878937c12946c36283b24dab91facf987","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}